{"articleNo":"2694","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2694&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 쌍용곰두리장학생 지원신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.03","hit":"11899","attachments":[{"name":"2011학년도 쌍용곰두리장학생 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2694&attachNo=2558"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">2011년도 쌍용곰두리장학생 지원신청을 아래와 같이 안내합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">. </span></p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">□ 신청자격 및 장학금 내역</span></span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; MARGIN-LEFT: 0.01pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 78.56pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 20.48pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">구 분</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 307.79pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 20.48pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">신 청 자 격</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 95.54pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 20.48pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">공 통 사 항</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 78.56pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 49.02pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">성적우수</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">장 학 생</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 307.79pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 49.02pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 전문대학, 일반대학교, 한국방송통신대학교, 대학원에 현재</span> <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">재학하고 있는 자로서 직전학기 평균 78점, 대학원은 평균 89점 이상인 가정형편이 어려운 자</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 95.54pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 164.66pt\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"3\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">- 장애등급 </span></p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">1급 ~ 4급까지</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">- 현재 재학 중</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">인 학생</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"></p>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"></p>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"></p>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"></p>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"></p>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"></p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 78.56pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 49.02pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">예 <!--StartFragment-->체능</span> </p>\n            <div align=\"center\"></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">특기장학생</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 307.79pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 49.02pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 예․체능 분야 전공학생으로 2008년 이후 국내외 예 체능대회</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">에서 입상한 경력이 있는 자</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">- 2008년 이후 국내외 예․체능대회 입상증명서 사본제출</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 78.56pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 66.62pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">정보통신</span> </p>\n            <div align=\"center\"></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">특기장학생</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 307.79pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 66.62pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 정보통신 분야 전공학생으로 2008년 이후 국내외 정보통신대회에서 입상한 경력이 있는 가정형편이 어려운 자</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">- 2008년 이후 국내외 정보통신대회 입상증명서 및 국가기술 자격증 사본제출</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 78.56pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 17.65pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">제한조건</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 403.33pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 17.65pt\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"2\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 정부의 학비지원 또는 기타 장학금을 받지 않는 학생 이어야 함</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 타 장학금과 중복수혜가 확인되었을 경우 지급된 장학금 전액 환수 조치</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 78.56pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 63.65pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">지 급 액</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 307.79pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 63.65pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 한국방송통신대학교 학생 학기당 25만원</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 전문대학, 산업대학 학생 학기당 100만원</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 4년제 대학생 및 대학원생 학기당 150만원</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 95.54pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 63.65pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">결격사유가 없는</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">한 2년간 지급</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">(전문대학, 산업대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\"> 1년간 지급)</span> </p>\n            <div></div>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">□ 제출서류</span> <p></p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">가. 장학생 지원신청서 및 추천서(본원 소정양식)</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">나. 2010학년도 2학기 성적증명서 1부 </span></p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">다. 장애인복지카드 사본이나 장애인임을 증명할 수 있는 서류 1부</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">라. 주민등록등본 및 건강보험증 사본 1부</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">마. 가정형편을 증명할 수 있는 국민기초생활보장수급권자 증명서 1부 또는 </span></p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 지방세세목별과세증명서(부, 모, 본인, 처) 각 1부</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">바. 각종대회 입상 등 국가기술자격증명서 사본 1부(예․체능 및 정보통신 특기장학생)</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">□ 신청방법 :</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">상기 제출서류를 구비하여 재학하고 있는 학교의 장학담당 부서를 통하여 학교장 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">명의에 의한 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">정식공문으로 신청(</span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">개인 신청 절대 불가)</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">.</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">□ 접수기간 및 접수처</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">가. 접수기간 : 2010. 12. 27 ~ 2011. 1.17 </span></p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">나. 신청서교부 : 본원 내방 또는 본원 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">(WWW.koddi.or.kr)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">에서 다운로드</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 홈페이지 - 자료실 - 서식자료 - “지원신청서” 검색 </span></p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">다. 접수방법 : 우편접수 또는 방문(팩스 및 인터넷 접수 불가)</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">라. 신청서 접수 : 한국장애인개발원 복지홍보팀(장학담당, 02- 3433- 0642)</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">150-917 서울 영등포구 의사당로 22 이룸센터 5층</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">2010년 12월 27 일</span> </p>\n<div></div>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" styl